      "facts": [
        "Opened by an earlier delta and closed before any content arrived: the same `<think></think>` in one delta renders nothing.",
        "A delta that ends exactly on `<think>` leaves the parser inside a think tag with no content yet, so no thinking segment carries that state. Open an empty block for it; otherwise the next delta lands as plain text.",
        "(e.g., just \"</think>\" or \"</think>text\"). In this case parseThinkTags returns empty or starts with text, but we still need to close the thinking block."
